<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第三幕 · 它是变量吗</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>三条证据，没有一条够格当基准</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 46, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: "center"}}>它是变量。而变量意味着，它可以换。</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "center", gap: 26, marginTop: 34}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 16, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", width: 64}}>P20</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)"}}>厂商自述</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 16, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", width: 64}}>P21</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)"}}>趋势级</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 16, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", width: 64}}>P22</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)"}}>品类共识的落点句</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 20, textAlign: "center"}}>我的结论靠的是它们指向同一个方向，不是其中任何一个数字。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>24 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
